          "headline": "RBI adds ₹1 lakh crore via two overnight repos as banks run short of cash",
          "summary": "The RBI lent banks ₹50,007 crore twice on Wednesday in one-day repo auctions. Demand in the first auction was ₹1.62 lakh crore, more than three times the amount offered, and rates cleared at 5.66% and 5.68%, above the 5.50% policy repo rate.",
