          "id": "markets-sensex-nifty-rebound-2026-11-25",
          "headline": "Sensex, Nifty rebound over 1.4% as money moves out of Asian chip stocks",
          "summary": "The Sensex jumped as much as 2,062 points to 84,498 and the Nifty touched 25,952 as markets reopened after Tuesday's holiday, before giving back part of the gain. At about 1:30 pm the Sensex was up 1.4% near 83,580 and the Nifty 1.4% near 25,709. HDFC Bank and ICICI Bank rose over 3%, and IT stocks such as TCS and Infosys gained, while Tata Steel and Titan slipped.",
